{"3700110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SONDER: Embrace The World", "steam_appid": 3700110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT SONDER &amp; TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why hello there, fellow exploration game fans! :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers behind <i>SONDER</i> are a bunch of friends from Austria (Europe - ...no, not the one with the kangaroos! :) ) who continue developing this game in their spare time. <strong>Originally, we started this game as our master project,</strong> exploring the depths of <strong>knowledge-based progression</strong> systems in video games, being a case study for <strong>cozy post-apocalyptic environments,</strong> and delving into <strong>sound design in time manipulated settings.</strong> Feel free to reach out and chat with us! =D We’d love to hear about you and your ideas! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're developing SONDER in our spare time, so the release date might be a bit fuzzy. Current roadmap aims for a release this year~ Stay tuned (wishlist <i>SONDER: Embrace The World</i> on Steam and tell your friends about us! It <u>really</u> helps us out ALOT)! ( ~'w')b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All developers of <i>SONDER</i> strive for a progressive use of new science &amp; technology. <br>We cannot overlook current issues that come with the use of generative artificial intelligence, and the global threats it opposes in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cybersecurity, data privacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >politics, misinformation, manipulation, transparency, biased information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ethics, intellectual property, job market, creativity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of this, <i>SONDER</i> does <strong>NOT</strong> use any type of AI-generated art, meaning that <strong>all assets and code (incl. 3D models, 2D art, story, text, marketing material etc.) are self-made.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time flows back and forth</strong> in this narrative, open-world cavern, harbouring a young research civilisation in the face of disaster. Embrace environmental clues that add up to an <strong>interwoven story</strong> of fear, resolve and a <strong>constant sense of discovery,</strong> defying the laws of time and space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SONDER: Embrace The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/eb262dbf50a99d40b24f17fb2ea1742b.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/eb262dbf50a99d40b24f17fb2ea1742b.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=798 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME RESEARCHERS! TIME FLOWS STRANGELY…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an enormous cave system, and all you remember is your research mission to <strong>save your civilization from an imminent flood</strong> in a world in which time now suddenly started flowing back and forth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/65f1fa1e931d2c96ad5750a26cf41bb7.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/65f1fa1e931d2c96ad5750a26cf41bb7.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY-RICH HISTORICAL CAVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully <strong>assess hints and environmental clues</strong> in this handcrafted environment that add up to a gripping, interwoven story about existential fear and unmatched resolve. Discover an abandoned underground city and <strong>unveil each layer of detail, some of which you won't notice at first</strong> - and all of this <strong>at your own pace</strong> and in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/e019443b31815fa82d31a2b27279ae20.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/e019443b31815fa82d31a2b27279ae20.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, ADAPT, EMBRACE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves of <i>SONDER</i> are packed with hidden mysteries giving you a constant sense of discovery. <strong>Adapt to rising water levels</strong> and the changing flow of time, <strong>accumulate all your knowledge</strong> about the world, and <strong>think outside of the box</strong> to reach undiscovered corners of the cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/9eb112c229db0e6dc19ea33f63f7e104.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/9eb112c229db0e6dc19ea33f63f7e104.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE YOUR CIVILIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is <strong>Project R*?</strong> What lies in the centre of the <strong>Ascendance’s Vault?</strong> Find the key to save your kind from a fatal destiny. Take a deep dive in this short, quiet and easy to finish adventure <strong>without combat, jumpscares or stressful timers...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/4462a96e37534462c9acd001af44a5ac.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/4462a96e37534462c9acd001af44a5ac.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time flows back and forth</strong> in this narrative, open-world cavern, harbouring a young research civilisation in the face of disaster. Embrace environmental clues that add up to an <strong>interwoven story</strong> of fear, resolve and a <strong>constant sense of discovery,</strong> defying the laws of time and space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SONDER: Embrace The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/eb262dbf50a99d40b24f17fb2ea1742b.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/eb262dbf50a99d40b24f17fb2ea1742b.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=798 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME RESEARCHERS! TIME FLOWS STRANGELY…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an enormous cave system, and all you remember is your research mission to <strong>save your civilization from an imminent flood</strong> in a world in which time now suddenly started flowing back and forth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/65f1fa1e931d2c96ad5750a26cf41bb7.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/65f1fa1e931d2c96ad5750a26cf41bb7.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY-RICH HISTORICAL CAVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully <strong>assess hints and environmental clues</strong> in this handcrafted environment that add up to a gripping, interwoven story about existential fear and unmatched resolve. Discover an abandoned underground city and <strong>unveil each layer of detail, some of which you won't notice at first</strong> - and all of this <strong>at your own pace</strong> and in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/e019443b31815fa82d31a2b27279ae20.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/e019443b31815fa82d31a2b27279ae20.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, ADAPT, EMBRACE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves of <i>SONDER</i> are packed with hidden mysteries giving you a constant sense of discovery. <strong>Adapt to rising water levels</strong> and the changing flow of time, <strong>accumulate all your knowledge</strong> about the world, and <strong>think outside of the box</strong> to reach undiscovered corners of the cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/9eb112c229db0e6dc19ea33f63f7e104.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/9eb112c229db0e6dc19ea33f63f7e104.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE YOUR CIVILIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is <strong>Project R*?</strong> What lies in the centre of the <strong>Ascendance’s Vault?</strong> Find the key to save your kind from a fatal destiny. Take a deep dive in this short, quiet and easy to finish adventure <strong>without combat, jumpscares or stressful timers...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras/4462a96e37534462c9acd001af44a5ac.avif?t=1788289147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/extras_big/4462a96e37534462c9acd001af44a5ac.avif?t=1788289147 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Time flows back and forth in this narrative, open-world cavern, harbouring a young research civilisation in the face of disaster. Embrace environmental clues that add up to an interwoven story of fear, resolve and a constant sense of discovery, defying the laws of time and space.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Swedish, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/7883c922a1a74b61f2a960674481b7cca34addae/header.jpg?t=1788289147", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/8d1249e4e8e92836208f016d981288e772093de6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788289147", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700110/8d1249e4e8e92836208f016d981288e772093de6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788289147", "website": "https://sonder-game.carrd.co/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7500 @ 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080, 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li